    <h2>TRE™ in a coaching context</h2>
    <p>Coaches absorb a lot from the people they work with. This session shows how TRE™ (Tension &amp;amp; Trauma Releasing Exercises) and self-induced neurogenic tremoring can become practical tools in your coaching, supporting nervous system regulation, embodied presence and lasting resilience for you and your clients.</p>
    <p>Isabelle Claus Teixeira and Saymara Ryon co-facilitate this live online session, which is hosted in partnership with <a href="https://neurogenic-integration.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Neurogenic Integration</a>.</p>

    <h2>What you will gain</h2>
    <ul class="ce-list">
      <li><strong>Earn 3 ICF CCEs</strong> — 1.5 Resource Development + 1.5 Core Competencies</li><li>Get to grips with the science of tremoring and nervous system regulation</li>
      <li>See how somatic tools can strengthen presence and rapport in coaching</li>
      <li>Try a guided practice that you can carry into your own work</li>
      <li>Join live online from anywhere in the world</li>
    </ul>

